{"ID":"20240220132631-oeekezv","Spec":"2","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240220132631-oeekezv","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240220132631-oeekezv\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162923-2s4pltn\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162934-84kdvrx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240312162934-84kdvrx\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:142,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:142\u0026#125;","title":"【小建中汤】","type":"doc","updated":"20240312162934"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240312162923-2s4pltn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-2s4pltn","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百一十一条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-5pz7zv6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-5pz7zv6","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」,阳脉濇,阴脉弦,法当腹中急痛,先与「小建中汤」。不差者,与「小柴胡汤」。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-p0wso9l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-p0wso9l","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阳脉濇，寸脉地方是涩脉。阴脉就是讲少腹部，弦脉就是有寒水在里面。不差者,不好者。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-ukxp9jf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-ukxp9jf","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"小建中汤方"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-ww7fd0d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-ww7fd0d","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"桂枝三两去皮，甘草二两炙，大枣十二枚劈，芍药六两，生姜三两切，胶饴一升。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-0z8rwep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-0z8rwep","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color6);"},"TextMarkType":"strong text","TextMarkTextContent":"右六味,以水七升,煮取三升,去滓,内胶饴,更上微火消解。温服一升,日三服。呕家不可用建中汤,以甜故也。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color6);\"}"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-kacpfsk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-kacpfsk","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"芍药是桂枝两倍。小建中汤实际是来自桂枝汤，芍药加倍，加了饴糖一升。"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","Properties":{"style":"color: var(--b3-font-color8);"},"TextMarkType":"text","TextMarkTextContent":"小孩子肚子痛，很皮，就是不吃饭，你看他的脸，两眼中间鼻根处，青黑的一条就是小建中汤症。"},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"color: var(--b3-font-color8);\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肚子里寒的嘛，所以就不喜欢吃东西。开处方芍药一定是比桂枝多，重用芍药的时候，肚子痛会去掉。同时炙甘草、干姜，桂枝能够降逆，麦芽糖（饴糖）是甜的，能够健脾胃。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-7cd7sxw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-7cd7sxw","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"这里是说遇到阳脉濇,阴脉弦,法当腹中急痛,先给「小建中汤」。小建中汤没有好再给小柴胡汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-1679988","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-1679988","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"为什么小柴胡汤，因为弦脉，少阳证主要的脉就是弦脉。肚子痛，虚寒的痛，小建中汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-tx15dcw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-tx15dcw","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"小孩子不喜欢吃饭，肚子痛，腹痛，小建中汤。平常身体不好，预防也可以吃小建中汤。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162923-607u8w3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162923-607u8w3","updated":"20240312162923"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"呕家不可用建中汤,以甜故也。呕吐的人不要用建中汤，里面有甜的饴糖，呕吐的人吃甜的会吐。这时用小柴胡汤。只要有恶心出现就进入少阳了。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162933-c8yckz7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162933-c8yckz7"}},{"ID":"20240312162934-aae3ua2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162934-aae3ua2","updated":"20240312162934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"第一百一十五条。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162934-aodetvw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162934-aodetvw","updated":"20240312162934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"原文：「伤寒」二三日,心中悸而烦者,「小建中汤」主之。"}]},{"ID":"20240312162934-84kdvrx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240312162934-84kdvrx","updated":"20240312162934"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 会用到小建中汤，就是里虚掉了。建中汤是专门治疗虚症的。如果说心中悸而烦，桂枝甘草汤，茯苓甘草桂枝都可以治心中悸而烦为什么这里用小建中汤。就是本身病人是虚的，你看他脸色很清很淡暗黄，小孩子不吃东西，身体很瘦，统统可以用建中汤。所以说得到伤寒，有表症，有里虚的，直接开小建中汤就可以了。"}]}]}